      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.5535598+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.68]     an index term that states where nulls sort keeps that placement in the stored definition, or is refused by name before any statement runs [SKIP]</Text>
