      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.5555146+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.68]     a unique index over lower(column) refuses two values that differ only in case, or is refused before any statement runs [SKIP]</Text>
