      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.5663527+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.69]     a decimal column stores a value no double holds exactly and refuses a second row with the same value written with another scale, or is refused before any statement runs [SKIP]</Text>
