      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.6590985+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.79]     a reconcile set creates an index where its table and column exist and skips one whose table is missing without failing, or is refused before any statement runs [SKIP]</Text>
