      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.6936912+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.82]     standalone writes from two lanes at once all land, and a read never waits for them [SKIP]</Text>
