      <RunInfo computerName="b21f193f5bd8" outcome="Warning" timestamp="2026-11-26T15:33:28.6961667+00:00">
        <Text>[xUnit.net 00:02:33.83]     a purge removes the row for good, including a soft-deleted one, and only inside the tenant [SKIP]</Text>
